# Keep the Docker build context tiny. The Dockerfile does NOT COPY the repo (code
# is bind-mounted at runtime), so nothing here is needed for the build — excluding
# it just avoids shipping huge/irrelevant dirs to the daemon and bloating context.
.git
.venv
venv
_workspace
**/__pycache__
.pytest_cache
*.pyc
.idea
.claude
logs
Server logs
Backupserverdata
*.zip
.env
